# Keep these files/dirs for deployment:
# - src/ (all source code)
# - corpus/ (formula models, needed by database)
# - config/ (except api_keys.yaml)
# - data/integral.db (database)
# - data/models/inference/ (inference-only checkpoints)
# - data/embeddings/ (pre-built FAISS caches)
# - latex2sympy2_custom/ (custom package)
# - requirements-prod.txt
